  "english": "CANON\nOF THE ASCENSION OF CHRIST OUR GOD\n__________________\nTHURSDAY. THE FEAST OF THE ASCENSION\nof Christ into heaven, which is the\nfortieth day from Easter. In the\nNight [Service], Processional hymn [Hetevak sharakan], Tone 8 [dk], \"Greatly Wondrous\" (Metsahrash).\nAnd the priests shall vest together and come\ninto the chancel, and begin the canticle of the dawn [ah.], Tone 5 [g3],\n\"He Ascended\" (Hambartsaw). Father [hymn], Tone 8 [dk], \"Blessed is the crown\nof sweetness.\" Magnificat [Mets.], \"Mother of Light, Mother of God.\"\nSong [of the Resurrection], \"He ascended,\nGod, with blessing.\" Litany, \"Let us say.\"\n\"Holy God, who didst ascend in glory to the Father.\" (Until the Coming of the\nSpirit, the Song, Litany, and the \"Holy God\"\nshall be said thus).\nAnd they shall go forth with the cross and the Gospel in procession, singing the\nhymn [sharakan], Tone 7 [gdz], \"He Ascended.\"\nPsalm 46 [47], \"God ascended with blessing.\"\nScripture, Song of Songs 3:6, \"Who is this that goeth up...\" to chapter 4:3, \"...from thy silence.\"\nProphecy, Isaiah 63:1, \"And who is this...\" to verse 6, \"...them to the earth.\"\nActs 1:1, \"The first book...\" to verse 14, \"...His brothers.\"\nAlleluia, Psalm 46 [47], \"God ascended.\"\nGospel, Luke 24:41, \"And while they yet...\" to verse 53, \"...and blessing God.\"\nHymn [sharakan], Tone 7 [gdz], \"Our Lord Christ Ascended.\"\nAfter the \"Stand up\" (Ort'i), Gospel,\nMark 16:9, \"Jesus having risen...\" to verse 20, \"...following them.\"\nAnd they shall bless the four corners of the world [Andastan]. Litany, \"By this Holy Cross.\"\nPrayer, \"Protect [us].\" And then:\nPsalm 23 [24], chanted: \"Lift up [your gates].\" Gospel,\nLuke 18:1, \"He spoke also a parable...\" to\nverse 14, \"...shall be exalted.\" Litany, \"Let us ask,\"\n\"Save [us].\" Prayer, \"By Thy almighty.\"\nAt the Midday Liturgy, Introit [Zhamamut], \"The heavenly powers were amazed,\"\nand \"Who ineffably.\" Antiphon [P'okh], \"Praise Jerusalem.\"\nHymn [sharakan], Tone 1 [adz], \"He who ascended.\"\nPsalm 118 [119], \"Blessed are they...\" [namely the sections:] \"My portion...\", \"I have done judgment...\", \"In my distress...\", \"I lifted up [my eyes].\"\nActs 1:1, \"The first book...\" to verse 14,\n\"...His brothers.\" Alleluia, Psalm 23 [24], \"Lift up,\nO princes, [your gates].\" Gospel, Matthew\n28:16, \"Now the eleven disciples...\" to verse\n20, \"...unto the end of the world.\" Hagiography [Srbasatsut'iun],\n\"Who is like [unto Thee].\"\n\nIn the Evening\nthey shall go forth with the cross and the Gospel\nand all decorations in procession, singing\nthe hymn [sharakan], Tone 7 [gdz], \"Our Lord\nChrist Ascended.\" Psalm, \"God ascended\nwith blessing.\" They shall read the morning\nScriptures and the Gospels, and\nthey shall bless the four corners of the world [Andastan]. Litany,\n\"By this Holy Cross.\" Prayer, \"Protect [us].\" And\nthen, chanted, Alleluia, Psalm 46 [47], \"God\nascended with blessing.\" Gospel,\nMatthew 19:1, \"And it came to pass when He finished...\"\nto verse 15, \"...He departed thence.\" And then, \"Bow down [thy ear]\" and \"Live.\"\nMessiah [Mese], \"The God of gods,\" \"From the rising of the sun.\"\nHambartsi [Hmb.], Tone 5 [g3],\n\"Who are co-planted,\" and \"Our Lord ascended\ninto heaven.\" Dismissal Psalm 23 [24], \"Lift up...\"",
